    "insights": [
      "Extreme monochromatic restraint: By relying entirely on a greyscale spectrum (black, white, and shades of gray), the UI acts as a neutral canvas that allows the colorful, generative AI media to take center stage.",
      "High-contrast foundations: The design uses pure black (#000000) and pure white (#FFFFFF) heavily, opting for stark contrast rather than softer dark-mode alternatives, which lends a cinematic and premium feel.",
      "Depth through opacity: Instead of introducing new hues for elevation, the interface utilizes translucent blacks and whites (e.g., #ffffff1a for borders, #10101066 for buttons) to achieve glassmorphism and visual hierarchy."
